Search verified EV charger specs in the OECS Hub registry. Supports a free-text query (a manufacturer/model/series name or a natural-language description of the charger needed, ranked by relevance), charger type, and manufacturer ID directly, plus a generic 'fields' filter that can match any field of the OECS charger spec (https://github.com/ChargePi/oecs) by dot-path, e.g. field "hardware.housing.material" with values ["aluminum"], "hardware.connectors.type" with values ["CCS2_Combo2"], or "manufacturer.country" with values ["DE"].
'minRatings' filters on aggregate user ratings per category (reliability, support, design, ease_of_use), e.g. category "reliability" with minAverage 4; chargers with no ratings in that category are excluded.
All filters - query, chargerType, manufacturerId, every entry in fields, and every entry in minRatings - are AND-matched: each one only narrows the result set further, so add more filters to narrow a search, never to broaden it. Results are paginated.
